msgid "Products sold on exMart.eg are intended for personal, household, or professional use by competent adults. Diagnostic devices are for informational purposes only and do not substitute for clinical medical advice. Health claims on our own-brand products comply with Egyptian regulatory standards and are not intended to diagnose, treat, or cure any condition."
